This repository is a fork of OpenWork (https://github.com/different-ai/openwork).
It ships the MIT-licensed portion of that work only: the upstream /ee directory,
which is licensed under the OpenWork Enterprise Edition License and requires an
OpenWork subscription for production use, is deliberately not part of this tree.
scripts/check-upstream-boundary.mjs enforces that.

The upstream copyright notice above is retained as the MIT license requires, and
is never replaced. Changes made in this fork are copyright Janghoon Lee (Redrob)
and contributors, and are released under the same MIT terms, so the whole tree
stays MIT. Each contributor keeps copyright in their own contribution; the notice
names them collectively rather than assigning anything.

